   <taskbody>
      <steps>
         <step>
            <cmd>Within X-Author for Contracts Advanced, click the <b>Work</b> tab.</cmd>
         </step>
         <step>
            <cmd>Click the More icon () on the left side of the navigation menu and select <b>Conga Copilot</b>. </cmd>
            <info>
               <image href="../attachments/thumbnails/231214040/231214010" width="23" height="36" placement="inline">
                     <alt>placeholder</alt>
                  </image>
               
            </info>
         </step>
         <step>
            <cmd>Enter your question in the search box on the bottom. For example, "What is the Agreement Name?" and "What is the limitation of liability cap?" </cmd>
            <info>
               <note type="note">
                  <p>The questions are retained until the document is checked-in again. Afterwards, they are deleted. </p>
               </note>
            </info>
         </step>
      </steps>
   </taskbody>
